SuperMimic-Reproduced
====================

The optional world-model integration prior, motion encoder design, terminal-state
recording, execution-only noise, distributed gradient averaging, evaluation/drift
protocol and numerical validation ideas were adapted from or informed by:

  CuboiLeo/SuperMimic-Reproduced
  https://github.com/CuboiLeo/SuperMimic-Reproduced
  Reference commit: ba6105349069bf040f1fdad60873d13138d505a2

These features implement or extend the method described in:

  Qiayuan Liao et al. (2026), SuperMimic: Scaling Humanoid Whole-Body Control
  with One Differentiable World Model. https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.28480

The reproduced code is an independent implementation, not the paper authors'
official code. File-level comments identify the relevant upstream source paths.
The upstream license notice is preserved below. The rest of wbc-mjlab remains
under its existing Apache-2.0 license.

